1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sejnhen Schönchen GÜNZBURG, née GELNHAUSEN: b. ? - d. 10 March 1657, Frankfurt-am-Main
2 CONT
2 CONT Valuable details gleaned courtesy of the following website:
2 CONT
2 CONT DigiBaeck Search Results | Leo Baeck Institute
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.lbi.org/digibaeck/results/?qtype=pid&term=258967
2 CONT
2 CONT Ele Toldot ([Burial records of the Jewish community of Frankfurt am Main]), 1241-1824
2 CONT
2 CONT Sejnhen, wife of Simon GIN..., daughter of Ajzek GELHAJZ z. l, died 10.03.1657 and was buried in same grave as her mother Minklin, wife of Ajzek
2 CONT
2 CONT House: goldne Rose
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Ajzek GELNHAUSEN z. weissen Rose (d. 15.10.1629), son of Zeligman
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Munkle (d. 05.03.1625), daughter of Itsek BLAD
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: 1603 or 1604 to Simon GÜNZBURG (d. 26.02.1659), son of Ajzek
2 CONT
2 CONT PLUS - cf. main sources cited for husband Simon GÜNZBURG.
2 CONT
2 CONT e.g.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Awrom GÜNZBURG z. gld. Rose, d. 06.09.1691
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Ajzek GÜNZBURG z. gld. Rose, d. 23.08.1709
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Hendlin (d. 16.03.1693), m. Jakef GÜNZBURG z. gld. Brünnen
2 CONT
2 CONT 4) Ester (d. 07.01.1679), m. Juzbel OPPENHEIM z. weissen Löwen
2 CONT
2 CONT 5) Edel (d. 06.08.1677), m. Nosen schwarz. Adler z. Bisemknopf
2 CONT
2 CONT And also cf. sources cited for daughter Ester m. OPPENHEIM & Hendlen m. GÜNZBURG  ... 
