2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Blum (d. 06.04.1677), daughter of Dawid KALLSTADT
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: Krejnle (d. 28.04.1707), daughter of Todres OPPENHEIM (once widowed she married Ziskind BINGEN)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) dajjan David ULF z. Armbrust (d. 19.02.17 ..?)
2 CONT
