2 CONT
2 CONT 4) Sorle (d. 19.08.1740), m. Mose WORMS z. Knoblauch
2 CONT
2 CONT 5) Sejnle (d. 21.02.1717) m. Dawid STRAUSS z. Knoblauch and then z. Pfanne
2 CONT
2 CONT 6) Hindle (d. 20.09.1747), m. Juzzel LEITER z. Leuchte, then to silb. Leuchter
2 CONT
2 CONT And also ...
