2 CONT The "old" Jakow Efrajim - named Gumpel - TRIER KATZ, husband of Kela, died 9 June 1751 and was buried next to his father, the "old" Jusfe TRIER
2 CONT
2 CONT House: Trommel
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Juzfe TRIER z. rot. Schild (d. 30.04.1719), son of Majer KATS
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Fogel (d. 19.09.1712), daughter of Jise OPPENHEIM
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: circa 1715 to Kejle (d. 08.01.1778), daughter of Nosen GANS
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) hazzan Jusfe TRIER z. rot. Hut, d. 06.11.1793
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Majer TRIER, d. 22.05.177?(illegible)
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Mose TRIER, d. 08.11.1778
2 CONT
2 CONT 4) Nosen, d. still a child 28.09.1747
2 CONT
2 CONT 5) Jentle (d. 14.11.1764), m. Lejzer SCHLOSS
2 CONT
2 CONT 6) Fogel (d. 18.04.1786), m. Zanwel LURJE
2 CONT
2 CONT 7) Sadle (d. 20.02.1799), m. Slome LURJE
