1 NOTE {geni:about_me} In her diary, Hendel's sister, Glückel of Hameln, wrote of Hendel's engagement to Baer Issachar Gomperz Kleve. "At that time my sister Hendele, of blessed memory, became engaged to the son of the learned Reb Gumpel
2 CONC  of Cleves. She received 1800 Reichsthalers as her dowery, in those days, a handsome sum, more than anyone had ever been dowered in Hamburg."
2 CONT
2 CONT Glückel goes on to say, (with a touch of sarcasm????) "Naturally, her match was considered the most important in all Germany and the whole world admired its excellence and the size of the dowery."
