1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''To stop confusion about Hinde (=Hindchen) Hannau - See Document in her profile - she had only one husband!!'''
2 CONT
2 CONT There might be a confusion - According to my data:  A 'Lehman JOSEPH Hanau' [Died 04/25/1738,] was married [1683]  to HINDE Briliin [d.02/06/1728]            [Daughter of Isak -d. 03/17/16 - Their SON was Jacob Lehman Hanau "Zum S
2 CONC trauss" [d. 1762] -see the tree!  Not sure about their other children!
2 CONT
2 CONT Her sister - HENDEL was married to Elieser Lippmann [d. 05/31/1680] and had a daughter- Gitle Schreihein.
2 CONT
2 CONT Another sister - HINLE [d.1735] was married to WOLF OPPENHEIMER - Their Daughter was Frumet Bacharach.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to timeline, it is possible that Hendel =Hinde, that Lippmann was the husband 1 and [as a widow?] she remarried  Joseph Hanau. [No. 2]
