2 CONT p. 13
2 CONT
2 CONT The head of our family was Rabbi David Tevele Auerbach. He was one of the most distinguished Jews of Vienna (Wien) in 1575. His eldest son, Gaon Rabbi Isaac Auerbach, died in Vienna in 1607. His second son, Gaon Rabbi Simon Wolf A
2 CONC uerbach, was Av Bet-Din in Polish communities, e.g. Turobin, Luboml, Lublin, Przemysl and Poznan (Posen).
