2 CONT The "old" Fogel LURIE, wife of the "old" Zanwel LURIE, daughter of Gumprih TRIER KATS, died 18.04.1786 and was buried next to her sister Jendle, wife of Lejzer, son of Fajb SLOS and next to her brother Majer ...
2 CONT
