1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Abraham Mendle Stern''' His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-44578639 Mendle Süskind Stern, zur goldenen Kanne] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34624481115 Keile Stern]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Abraham married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34624480090 Fogel Stern]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34624480060 Süskind Abraham Stern]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on September 17, 1762 in Frankfurt am Main, Hessen-Nassau, Preussen and was buried in Battonnstraße Jewish cemetery, Frankfurt am Main, Hessen-Nassau, Preussen. 
2 CONT ----
