2 CONC rich and Sara Myriam Benedict  Husband of Zipora Goldschmidt (Hameln)  Father of Sara Gomperz; Gompel Ephraïm Emmerich; Salman Gomperz (Emmerich); Simelie Zimlé Dinah Rizche Lambert; Wulf and 1 other  Brother of Sara Hitzel Gomper
