2 CONT Moses Salomon Salman († 17. Juli 1708 in Emmerich), "Stadlan", Inhaber hoher Ehrenämter der Landesjudenschaft. Seine Witwe Judith Juta Tamar überlebte ihn um etliche Jahre, eine Tochter blieb in Emmerich, die anderen Kinder gingen
2 CONC  nach Hamburg, Fürth und Wien und Amsterdam. 
2 CONT
2 CONT English Translation: Moses Salomon Salman († July 17, 1708 in Emmerich), "Stadlan", holder of high honorary positions in the State Jewry. His widow Judith Juta Tamar survived him by several years, one daughter stayed in Emmerich, 
2 CONC the other children went to Hamburg, Fürth and Vienna and Amsterdam.
