2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT [http://www.loebtree.com/heller.html '''Loebtree''']:
2 CONT
2 CONT Jakob KOPPEL FRAENKEL HELLER-WALLERSTEIN (b. Austria, d. 15 Sept. 1612, Vienna, Austria) married Mirl Sarah TEOMIM (b. 9 Jan. 1575, Vienna, Austria, d. 21 Feb. 1639, Vienna, Austria) daughter of Dwerl POMELITZ and Meschullam Salma
2 CONC n TEOMIM (d. 29 Aug. 1621 Vienna) son of Rebecca Sterin HOROWITZ [bat Israel HaLevi] (b. ca. 1545) and Rabbi Moses Aaron TEOMIM (b. ca. 1550 Vienna, d. 1609 Prague) son of Rabbi Simeon TEOMIM-LEMAL.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jakob and Sarah had seven children together.
2 CONT
2 CONT No. 7 child was David SECKEL FRAENKEL. His 3 children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.  Rabbi '''Jehuda FRAENKEL''' (d. 31 May 1735) married '''Pessel Bermann II MIRELS''' (d. 13 Feb. 1727). Their son was '''Isaac SECKEL BERLIN''' (d. 1754) 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  Baermann FRAENKEL
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  Aron FRAENKEL 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Also referenced as:  Baerman Eliahu Samuel Mateh Yissachar Fraenkel. And as:  Yitzchak (Isaac)
