2 CONT Rachel Heller-Wallerstein (Loew), [Maharal dau. #6] dies in 1632 in Prague as the widow of Rabbi Abraham Wallerstein.
2 CONT
2 CONT Most genealogies conclude that Abraham, son of Moshe Heller Wallerstein - Chief Rabbi of Germany, married Rachel Loew, dau. #4 of the Maharal of Prague.
2 CONT
2 CONT Abraham Wallerstein Frankl of Prague has several entries in Liber judeorum albus
