1 NOTE {geni:about_me} On the Ele Toldot sheet for Loeb HO 2883 son of Josbel, his son David Tewele and his son Josef Josbel are shown correctly, but the Ester HO 3359, who is shown is actually the daughter of Loeb (of Hanau) son of Jose
2 CONC l. Because he did not live in Frankfurt, there is no Ele Toldot sheet for Loeb, son of Josel, but those of his children or grandchildren who DO have sheets (his dau. Zerle HO 4526, his granddau. Rechle HO 4620 e' Salomon Bendit Go
2 CONC ldschmidt Kassel, (daughter of his dau Rechle, who died in childbirth), and his daughter, Ester HO 3359, offer very helpful clues.
2 CONT
2 CONT And the Ele Toldot sheet for (Sara) Ester HO 3359 =14 XI 1769, daughter of Loeb Wetzlar of Hanau, is of huge help because it specifies that she was buried next to her grandmother, the wife of Josel Wetzlar [this is Rechle Limburg 
2 CONC HO 1515] and her great-grandfather, Abraham Wetzlar. These three graves are #4043 (HO 3359), #4042 (HO 1515), and #3826 (HO 1598), which confirms the identities.
1 FAMC @F6000000125490406822@
1 RFN geni:6000000121402667840
1 SUBM @S6000000002764082210@
1 OBJE
