1 NAME Zerle /Wetzlar/
2 GIVN Zerle
2 SURN Wetzlar
2 _MARNM Rindskopf
1 SEX F
1 DEAT
2 DATE 12 AUG 1807
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Zerle HO 4526 died at an old age on 12 VIII 1807, having been married to Jacob Rindskopf. Her father is described as the late Loeb Wetzlar m'Hanau. Rechle HO 4620 (daughter of Chaim Kassel) died at "68" (actually 6
2 CONC 6) on 16 VII 1810 (her mother, Rechle, having died in Offenbach in Tishri 1743 per Offenbach Memorbuch) and is buried next to her aunt Zerle HO 4526. [To add to the confusion, Rechle HO 4620 also had two sisters, Golde (named for 
2 CONC Golde Heine) and Zerle (named for the same ancestress Zerle HO 4526 was named for, but not yet identifed). Golde and Zerle were both wives of Isaac Bing of Offenbach, and he had, by Zerle, the son, Chaim who died in 1855 in Amster
2 CONC dam, who is mentioned on the Ele Toldot sheet for Rechle HO 4620. This Chaim is Rechle's nephew, not her father.]
