1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ester KATZ, née KOPPEL: b.? - d. 23 March 1692, Frankfurt am Main
2 CONT
2 CONT Presumably the mother of all four of Salomon's children, as the 4th. - already married - child died in 1690, i.e. two years before Ester's death and the father's 2nd. marriage to Schönchen, née STRAUSS ...
2 CONT
2 CONT Valuable details gleaned courtesy of the following website:
2 CONT
2 CONT DigiBaeck Search Results | Leo Baeck Institute
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.lbi.org/digibaeck/results/?qtype=pid&term=258967
2 CONT
2 CONT Ele Toldot ([Burial records of the Jewish community of Frankfurt am Main]), 1241-1824
2 CONT
2 CONT Ester, wife of Zalman kohen dajjan z. roten Löwen, daughter of Jakow KOPPEL died 23.03.1692 and was buried next to Simon GINSPURG (sic) & Kalman KOHEN ...
2 CONT
2 CONT House: roter Löwe
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Koppel (d. 02.06.1658), son of Mose
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Hindhen (d. 14.08.1681), daughter of Jisrael
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: Zalman (d. 24.04.1703), son of Kalman KATS (as widower he then married Sejnhen).
