1 NAME Feist Herz /Gans/ z. Kaltbad
2 GIVN Feist Herz
2 NSFX z. Kaltbad
2 _MARNM Gans
2 NICK Feis ben Hirz
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1740
1 DEAT
2 DATE 22 APR 1816
2 PLAC Frankfurt am Main, Hessen-Nassau, Preussen
2 ADDR
1 BURI
2 DATE 23 APR 1816
2 PLAC Battonnstraße Jewish Cemetery, Frankfurt am Main, Hessen-Nassau, Preussen
