1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Tombstone reads...
2 CONT
2 CONT "Fradle, wife of the learned R. Salomon Toeplitz, daughter of the respected late Amschel Kulp, died and was buried Thursday 24th Iyar 5514. A respected woman - who can recount her merits. Devoted to her household and her husband. 
2 CONC She trained her children to Torah and good deeds."
2 CONT
2 CONT Fradle Kulp belonged to the Kulp Family which settled in Frankfurt in 1505, and lived in the "Weisse Rose" (White Rose) at 191 Judengasse. 
